<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani yarn rates end steady, seen stable.</title>
<headline>Pakistani yarn rates end steady, seen stable.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed unchanged on Sunday and are likely to remain pegged to current levels because of steady conditions in the domestic cotton market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for a 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:</p>
<p>				     Sunday    Previous</p>
<p>    Baig (Magic)		 470	    470</p>
<p>    Globe (Hina)		 485	    485</p>
<p>    Shafiq (Gold ky)	   460	    460</p>
<p>    ($1 = 40.22 rupees)    -- Ovais Subhani 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
